{"id": "271", "question": "earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy", "gt": "The earliest signs of pregnancy often include mood swings and unusual emotional behavior due to a flood of hormones in the body. Dizziness can also occur as pregnancy causes blood vessels to dilate and blood pressure to drop. Other early symptoms can include a missed period, bloating, spotting, and cramping. Approximately half of all pregnant women experience nausea and vomiting, and around 3 in 10 women experience nausea without vomiting, with these symptoms typically starting around six weeks after their last period.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe reasoning steps are:\n1. Identify the key information in the passage related to the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy.\n2. Analyze the information provided to understand what signs and symptoms are mentioned.\n3. Determine if there are specific details about the timing of these signs and symptoms.\n4. Check if there are any examples or comparisons given in the passage.\n5. Summarize the information found in the passage to answer the question.\nThe reasoning steps are:\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 31.05, "generation_time_seconds": 30.9986, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0429, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 785, 32711, 7354, 525, 24391, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0, -0.7169, -0.0406, -0.0004, -0.0, -0.2426, -9.6082, -14.5184, -12.2918, -2.2007, -7.086, -5.9102, -6.6154, -7.7784, -5.5586, -2.7469, -1.345, -1.0354, -1.8489, -1.187, -0.8