{"id": "576", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are some ways to quickly get rid of mice:\n\n1. Take immediate action to get rid of mice as soon as possible, as they can quickly take up residence in your home and start nesting (Passage 1).\n2. Seal off all entry points into your home, including holes around pipes and vents, using steel wool to prevent mice from getting back in (Passage 2).\n3. Get rid of any sources of food for mice and rats, as they will quickly take advantage of any food left behind by humans (Passage 3).\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages. The passages do not provide specific instructions on how to quickly get rid of mice once they have entered a home.", "pred": "Quick methods to get rid of mice involve a combination of exclusion, trapping, and deterrents. Exclusion involves sealing off entry points and removing food sources. Trapping can involve using live traps or snap traps. Deterrents can include using ultrasonic devices, sticky traps, or physical barriers.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Answer: Quick methods to get rid of mice involve a combination of exclusion, trapping, and deterrents. Exclusion involves sealing off entry points and removing food sources. Trapping can involve using live traps or snap traps. Deterrents can include using ultrasonic devices, sticky traps, or physical barriers.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. The question asks for a method to quickly get rid of mice.\n2. Mice are known to be a common pest in homes and businesses.\n3. To effectively deal with mice, one needs to understand their behavior and habits.\n4. Effective methods often involve a combination of exclusion, trapping, and deterrents.\n5. Exclusion involves sealing off entry points and removing food sources.\n6. Trapping can involve using live traps or snap traps.\n7. Deterrents can include using ultrasonic devices, sticky traps, or physical barriers.\n8. Quick methods might involve a combination of these techniques, focusing on immediate\nAnswer: Quick methods to get rid of mice involve a combination of exclusion, trapping, and deterrents. Exclusion involves sealing off entry points and removing food sources. Trapping can involve using live traps or snap traps. Deterrents can include using ultrasonic devices, sticky traps, or physical barriers.\nThe reasoning steps are:\n\nAnswer: Quick methods to get rid of mice involve a combination of exclusion, trapping, and deterrents. Exclusion involves sealing off entry points and removing food sources. Trapping can involve using live traps or snap traps. Deterrents can include using ultrasonic devices, sticky traps, or physical barriers.", "time_sec": 24.77, "generation_time_seconds": 24.7273, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0335, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 576, 3405, 17064, 369, 264, 1714, 311, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 624, 17, 13, 386, 558, 525, 3881, 311, 387, 264, 4185, 43785, 304, 10415, 323, 9675, 624, 18, 13, 2014, 13444, 3484, 448, 23627, 11, 825, 3880, 311, 3535, 862, 7709, 323, 25785, 624, 19, 13, 46923, 5413, 3545, 21058, 264, 10601, 315, 41208, 11, 92569, 11, 323, 82620, 82, 624, 20, 13, 1374, 8957, 17601, 65834, 1007, 4343, 3501, 323, 17592, 3607, 8173, 624, 21, 13, 1163, 3629, 646, 21058, 1667, 3887, 44560, 476, 10658, 44560, 624, 22, 13, 422, 1404, 7976, 82, 646, 2924, 1667, 36132, 42275, 7611, 11, 27402, 44560, 11, 476, 6961, 29640, 624, 23, 13, 17251, 5413, 2578, 21058, 264, 10601, 315, 1493, 12538, 11, 21080, 389, 13922], "logp_list": [-0.0, -1.409, -0.0002, -3.9166, -0.5053, -0.0243, -0.9433, -0.2194, -0.1195, -0.0001, -0.02, -0.0089, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -0.1613, -0.0001, 0.0, -9.4151, -0.0, -0.103, -3.7668, -0.1431, -0.0996, -0.9275, -0.7121, -0.124, -1.1894, -1.5306, -0.0287, -2.5122, -0.2187, -0.0, 0.0,