{"id": "49", "question": "how to fold a quilt", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to fold a quilt:\n\n1. Lay the quilt on a flat surface.\n2. Fold the lower right corner up towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\n3. Fold the lower left corner up towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\n4. Fold the top left corner down towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\n5. Fold the top right corner down towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"How to fold a quilt\" can be summarized in five steps:\n\n1. Lay the quilt flat.\n2. Fold lower right corner up.\n3. Fold lower left corner up.\n4. Fold top left corner down.\n5. Fold top right corner down.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nGiven the first step, which is \"At the end, output: Answer:[your answer here]\", the next logical reasoning step is to proceed with the task of folding a quilt based on the information provided in the passage. The passage does not contain specific instructions on how to fold a quilt, so the answer will be \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\" This step sets up the expectation that the subsequent reasoning will involve interpreting the given information to provide a response.\nThe reasoning steps are:\nGiven the first step, which is \"At the end, output: Answer:[your answer here]\", the next logical reasoning step is to proceed with the task of folding a quilt based on the information provided in the passage. The passage does not contain specific instructions on how to fold a quilt, so the answer will be \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\" This step sets up the expectation that the subsequent re