{"id": "272", "question": "earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy", "gt": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings, dizziness, bloating, spotting, cramping, nausea, and vomiting.", "pred": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy can include a missed period, breast tenderness, fatigue, nausea, and frequent urination. These symptoms typically begin around 6-12 days after conception. Some women may also experience mood swings, food cravings, and slight spotting or bleeding, known as implantation bleeding, which can occur around 6-12 days after conception. It's important to note that these symptoms can vary from person to person and may not be present in all women. Additionally, some women may experience no symptoms at all in the early stages of pregnancy. Answer: [The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy can include a missed period, breast tenderness, fatigue, nausea, and frequent urination. These symptoms typically begin around 6-12 days after conception. Some women may also experience mood swings, food cravings, and slight spotting or bleeding, known as implantation bleeding, which can occur around 6-12 days after conception. It's important to note that these symptoms can vary from person to person and may not be present in all women. Additionally, some women may experience no symptoms at all in the early stages of pregnancy.]", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Answer: The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy can include a missed period, breast tenderness, fatigue, nausea, and frequent urination. These symptoms typically begin around 6-12 days after conception. Some women may also experience mood swings, food cravings, and slight spotting or bleeding, known as implantation bleeding, which can occur around 6-12 days after conception. It's important to note that these symptoms can vary from person to person and may not be present in all women. Additionally, some women may experience no symptoms at all in the early stages of pregnancy. Answer: [The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy can include a missed period, breast tenderness, fatigue, nausea, and frequent urination. These symptoms typically begin around 6-12 days after conception. Some women may also experience mood swings, food cravings, and slight spotting or bleeding, known as implantation bleeding, which can occur around 6-12 days after conception. It's important to note that these symptoms can vary from person to person and may not be present in all women. Additionally, some women may experience no symptoms at all in the early stages of pregnancy.]", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Identify the type of logical reasoning involved: This question requires identifying the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy based on given passages.\n2. Analyze the given passages to find specific information about the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy. Look for any mention of physical changes, mood shifts, or other indicators that occur early in pregnancy.\n3. Look for any specific examples, numbers, or comparisons mentioned in the passages that relate to the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy. Note these details as they will be used to support the answer.\n\nAnswer: The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy can include a missed period, breast tenderness, fatigue, nausea, and frequent urination. These symptoms typically begin around 6-12 days after conception. Some women may also experience mood swings, food cravings, and slight spotting or bleeding, known as implantation bleeding, which can occur around 6-12 days after conception. It's important to note that these symptoms can vary from person to person and may not be present in all women. Additionally, some women may experience no symptoms at all in the early stages of pregnancy. Answer: [The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy can include a missed period, breast tenderness, fatigue, nausea, and frequent urination. These symptoms typically begin around 6-12 days after conception. Some women may also experience mood swings, food cravings, and slight spotting or bleeding, known as implantation bleeding, which can occur around 6-12 days after conception. It's important to note that these symptoms can vary from person to person and may not be present in all women. Additionally, some women may experience no symptoms at all in the early stages of pregnancy.]", "time_sec": 30.876, "generation_time_seconds": 30.7995, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0688, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0, -3.0086, 0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, 0.0, -0.001, -0.0, -0.0066, -0.0004, -24.0625, -18.5048, -7.601, -11.4092, -7.4723, -7.7693, -9.4114, -7.7466, -6.5071, -6.3712, -7.882, -6.472, -3.4597, -1.2518, -1.8708, -4.0122, -6.0791], "cumulative_logprob": -140.8997, "norm_logp": -5.2185, "input_len": 142, "output_tokens": 27}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 1, "token_ids": [198, 785, 32711, 7354, 525, 24391, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0, -0.7169, -0.0406, -0.0004, -0.0, -0.2426, -9.6082, -14.5184, -12.2918, -2.2007, -7.086, -5.9102, -6.6154, -7.7784, -5.5586, -2.7469, -1.345, -1.0354, -1.8489, -1.187, -0.8876, -0.4611, -0.2543, -0.6174, -1.4229, -3.6591, -4.2071], "cumulative_logprob": -92.2409, "norm_logp": -3.4163, "input_len": 142, "output_tokens": 27}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 2, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 64547, 279, 943, 315, 19819, 32711, 6398, 25, 1096, 3405, 7460, 24588, 279, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 