{"id": "439", "question": "how to find someone in france", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's how to find someone in France:\n\n1. Use a people search website specifically designed for France, such as People Search France.\n2. Check the French white pages (in English) at PagesJaunes.fr. Instead of typing Paris in the City field, write IDF (or Ile de France) in the Dept district or region field to search for the person in Paris and its suburbs.\n3. Post a missed connection (MC) on Paris Craigslist.\n4. Visit the Pages Blanches (the French version of the white pages) at PagesJaunes.fr. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field, and optionally enter a first name in the Prenom field. Enter address information, if known, in the Ou section. Click Trouver to search for the name. The search results will display name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n- Identify the purpose of finding someone in France.\n- Consider the context and specifics of the situation (e.g., personal reasons, professional reasons, etc.).\n- Research the most effective methods for locating someone in France.\n- Evaluate the feasibility and practicality of these methods based on the available resources and circumstances.\n- Determine the best course of action to take in order to find the person efficiently and respectfully.\nThe reasoning steps are:\n- Identify the purpose of finding someone in France.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 16.449, "generation_time_seconds": 16.41, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0307, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 12, 64547, 279, 7428, 315,