{"id": "715", "question": "what exercises tone the chest", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest are:\n\n1. Modified tri-set for the chest (mentioned in passage 2)\n2. Pushups with heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses (mentioned in passage 2)\n\nThese exercises are designed to pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue surrounding them, allowing for more muscle growth.", "pred": "Exercises that tone the chest include push-ups, pull-ups, and weightlifting exercises. Push-ups work the chest, shoulders, and triceps, while pull-ups primarily target the back and biceps but also engage the chest muscles. Weightlifting exercises, such as bench presses and chest flys, directly target the chest muscles for growth and toning.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Answer: Exercises that tone the chest include push-ups, pull-ups, and weightlifting exercises. Push-ups work the chest, shoulders, and triceps, while pull-ups primarily target the back and biceps but also engage the chest muscles. Weightlifting exercises, such as bench presses and chest flys, directly target the chest muscles for growth and toning.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the key elements of the question. The question asks about exercises that tone the chest. This involves understanding what constitutes chest toning exercises and recognizing the specific details provided in the passages.\nExamine the passages provided for any mention of exercises specifically designed to tone the chest. Look for keywords such as \"chest toning exercises,\" \"upper body exercises,\" or any other relevant terms that might indicate the type of exercises being referred to.\nBased on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest include push-ups, pull-ups, and weightlifting exercises. These exercises target the chest muscles by engaging the pectoralis major and other related muscles. Push-ups work the chest, shoulders, and triceps, while pull-ups primarily target the back and biceps but also engage the chest muscles. Weightlifting exercises, such as bench presses and chest flys, directly target the chest muscles for growth and toning.\n\nAnswer: Exercises that tone the chest include push-ups, pull-ups, and weightlifting exercises. Push-ups work the chest, shoulders, and triceps, while pull-ups primarily target the back and biceps but also engage the chest muscles. Weightlifting exercises, such as bench presses and chest flys, directly target the chest muscles for growth and toning.", "time_sec": 15.285, "generation_time_seconds": 15.2268, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0518, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 3070, 28301, 1437, 279, 943, 315, 10158, 95518, 576, 3405, 17064, 911, 22932, 429, 11689, 16232, 279, 15138, 13, 1096, 23945, 429, 279, 4226, 1265, 5244, 389, 22932, 429, 15503, 2169, 279, 15138, 23648, 382, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0, -1.2964, -0.0001, -4.6648, -0.0089, -0.001, -0.0297, -1.2669, -0.0, -0.0626, -0.3299, -0.8094, -0.0099, -0.0395, -0.3908, -0.0197, -0.0007, -0.8035, -0.0234, -0.0, 0.0, -0.258, -0.1304, -0.4346, -1.4333, -0.1175, -1.178, -0.1443, -0.0848, -0.0, -0.0187, -0.0749, -2.614, -0.1361, -0.1147, -0.5078, -0.0202, -0.4912, -20.1044, -Infinity], "cumulative_logprob": -Infinity, "norm_logp": -Infinity, "input_len": 141, "output_tokens": 40}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 1, "token_ids": [198, 28301, 1437, 279, 1376, 5424, 315, 279, 3405, 13, 576, 3405, 17064, 911, 22932, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 13, 1096, 17601, 8660, 1128, 41575, 15138, 8766, 287, 22932, 323, 48083, 279, 3151, 3565, 3897, 304, 279, 46769, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0, -2.5464, -0.0083, -0.1396, -1.1241, -1.6557, -0.2884, -0.0024, -0.0058, -3.2289, -0.0701, -0.0137, -0.1732, -0.1723, -0.0074, -0.0001, -0.0432, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0774, -1.5505, -1.5778, -0.1399, -0.6378, -1.