{"id": "260", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "MSM powder offers several benefits. It helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, thereby increasing energy levels. It also makes cell walls more permeable. The powder aids in the absorption of more nutrients, particularly when paired with Co-enzyme Q10. Additionally, MSM powder can help relieve muscular aches and pains and reduce inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "pred": "The benefits of MSM powder include helping with joint pain and inflammation.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Answer: The benefits of MSM powder include helping with joint pain and inflammation.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Identify the key information about MSM powder from the given passage.\n2. Determine what specific benefits are mentioned regarding MSM powder.\n3. Analyze the evidence or examples provided to support these benefits.\n4. Use the identified information and evidence to formulate the answer.\nThe key information about MSM powder from the given passage is that it is used for joint pain and inflammation. The specific benefits mentioned are that it helps with joint pain and inflammation.\nThe next logical reasoning step is:\n\nAnswer: The benefits of MSM powder include helping with joint pain and inflammation.", "time_sec": 16.741, "generation_time_seconds": 16.6988, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0363, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 64547, 279, 1376, 3501, 911, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 504, 279, 2661, 46769, 624, 17, 13, 9192, 369, 3151, 10295, 11, 5109, 11, 476, 35495, 9733, 304, 279, 46769, 429, 1824, 279, 4226, 624, 18, 13, 29279, 678, 3565, 12613, 279, 4226, 525, 5230, 2041, 7842, 9250, 1995, 624, 19, 13, 1416, 279, 46769, 653, 537, 6644, 14016, 1995, 11, 31094, 448, 330, 17075, 