{"id": "716", "question": "what exercises tone the chest", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, the following exercises are mentioned as toning the chest:\n\n* Modified tri-set for the chest (not specified)\n* Pushups\n* Dumbbell bench presses\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"What exercises tone the chest?\" based on the given passages is:\n\nModified tri-set for the chest, pushups, and dumbbell bench presses.", "pred": "Exercises that tone the chest include push-ups, chest presses, and flyes. Push-ups are a bodyweight exercise that targets the chest, shoulders, and triceps. Chest presses can be performed with dumbbells, a barbell, or a machine, and they work the chest muscles by pushing the weight away from the body. Flyes, also known as chest flyes, involve lying on a bench and moving weights out to the sides, which targets the chest muscles. These exercises are commonly used to tone and strengthen the chest.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Answer: Exercises that tone the chest include push-ups, chest presses, and flyes. Push-ups are a bodyweight exercise that targets the chest, shoulders, and triceps. Chest presses can be performed with dumbbells, a barbell, or a machine, and they work the chest muscles by pushing the weight away from the body. Flyes, also known as chest flyes, involve lying on a bench and moving weights out to the sides, which targets the chest muscles. These exercises are commonly used to tone and strengthen the chest.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nTo determine what exercises tone the chest, I need to analyze the given passage to identify specific exercises mentioned for chest toning. If no exercises are mentioned, I will provide a general answer based on commonly known chest-toning exercises.\nThe reasoning steps are:\nThe given passage does not contain any specific information about exercises that tone the chest. Therefore, I will provide a general answer based on commonly known chest-toning exercises.\n\nAnswer: Exercises that tone the chest include push-ups, chest presses, and flyes. Push-ups are a bodyweight exercise that targets the chest, shoulders, and triceps. Chest presses can be performed with dumbbells, a barbell, or a machine, and they work the chest muscles by pushing the weight away from the body. Flyes, also known as chest flyes, involve lying on a bench and moving weights out to the sides, which targets the chest muscles. These exercises are commonly used to tone and strengthen the chest.", "time_sec": 15.867, "generation_time_seconds": 15.8353, "selection_time_seconds": 0.027, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 1249, 8253, 1128, 22932, 16232, 279, 15138, 11, 358, 1184, 311, 23643, 279, 2661, 21085, 311, 10542, 3151, 22932, 9733, 369, 15138, 8766, 287, 13, 1416, 902, 22932, 525, 9733, 11, 358, 686, 3410, 264, 4586, 4226, 3118, 389, 16626, 3881, 15138, 74635, 287, 22932, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0, -2.8589, -0.4482, -0.1947, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0194, -2.2536, -0.1716, -0.0168, -1.2877, -0.0076, -0.4426, -1.6806, -2.3744, -0.3817, -1.5817, -0.001, -1.1401, -1.0136, -0.1503, -0.0016, 0.0, -0.0195, -0.7245, -0.8904, -0.6552, -0.0004, -0.2683, -0.0736, -0.1665, -0.2372, -1.9993, -1.6556, -0.4091, -0.3749, -0.0353, -0.0, -3.7947, -0.0283, -0.1767, -0.1794, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.1544, -0.0761], "cumulative_logprob": -27.9457, "norm_logp": -0.5822, "input_len": 141, "output_tokens": 48}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 1, "token_ids": [198, 17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list"