{"id": "250", "question": "how to grill pork chops, allrecipes.com", "gt": "To grill pork chops according to allrecipes.com, preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat and lightly oil the grate. In a bowl, mix together seasoned salt, black pepper, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, Worcestershire sauce, and smoke flavoring. Rinse the pork chops and sprinkle the wet chops on both sides with the spice mixture. Massage the spice rub into the meat and let it stand for 10 minutes. Grill the chops over indirect heat for about 12 minutes per side or until they are no longer pink inside.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nBased on the given instruction, the next logical reasoning step would be to provide the specific details or instructions on how to grill pork chops from the Allrecipes.com website if the passages contain the relevant information. If the passages do not provide sufficient details, the answer should state \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\"\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.\nThe reasoning steps are:\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 13.168, "generation_time_seconds": 13.1135, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0483, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 7039, 429, 498, 614, 279, 2266, 323, 279, 7600, 11, 358, 686, 10354, 311, 23643, 279, 3405, 323, 279, 2661, 21085, 311, 10542, 279, 3151, 3565, 2567, 311, 4226, 279, 3405, 911, 1081, 9400, 35067, 90078, 504, 2009, 49859, 905, 382, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0, -7.3539, -2.6053, -2.5551, -0.433, -0.8306, -3.