cific examples, numbers, or comparisons given to evaluate the quality or functionality of patterned rollers. Therefore, the passage does not contain sufficient information to determine how well patterned rollers work.\n\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 12.235, "generation_time_seconds": 12.2047, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0258, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0, -0.4678, 0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0006, -0.0, -0.0041, -0.0005, -24.6875, -19.2083, -5.6288, -5.8365, -9.2516, -7.8274, -9.4117, -8.3634, -6.9287, -6.7489, -7.7527, -6.6375, -3.7746, -1.3945, -2.057, -4.6364, -5.9007, -5.9009, -6.7643, -5.6933, -4.4315, -3.6223, -5.7709, -5.7181, -4.4553, -4.3579, -6.0136, -5.7181, -4.1274, -3.315, -3.2543, -4.6865, -5.3656, -6.32, -4.6055, -2.056, -0.8563, -2.7208, -4.5035, -6.7467, -6.6327, -4.6367, -1.6227, -2.2017, -3.536, -4.4306, -5.2258, -3.4552, -1.5554, -0.9305, -0.4612, -1.7446, -1.9198, -2.9704, -2.9073, -3.8364, -5.8888, -6.7852, -6.2528, -5.1585, -4.8434, -2.8615, -1.3769,