{"id": "485", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, it appears that your Snapchat account has been temporarily locked due to using third-party apps. According to passage 2, Snapchat does not guarantee security when using third-party apps, and they may lock your account if they detect such usage. Passage 3 also mentions that Snapchat has taken steps to punish individuals who use third-party apps, which could result in account lockout.\n\nIt's possible that you have been warned multiple times by Snapchat about using third-party apps, as mentioned in passage 1, and your account has been locked as a result. To regain access to your account, you may need to stop using third-party apps and wait for an official Snapchat app to become available for your device, as suggested in passage 2.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\nThe reasoning steps are:\nPlease provide the passages or any additional context so I can analyze them and provide a proper answer.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 6.809, "generation_time_seconds": 6.7712, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0329, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0, -0.4767, 0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0008, -0.0, -0.005, -0.0008], "cumulative_logprob": -0.4835, "norm_logp": -0.0483, "input_len": 142, "output_tokens": 10}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 1, "token_ids": [198, 17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0, -0.4767, 0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0008, -0.0, -0.005, -0.0008], "cumulative_logprob": -0.4835, "norm_logp": -0.0483,