{"id": "598", "question": "where is dove soap headquarters", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, the headquarters of Dove Soap can be located in:\n\nPassage 1 states that if you want to speak to a live representative, you can call them at 1-800-761-DOVE (3683) from Monday to Friday between 8:30 AM to 6:00 PM Eastern Time. This suggests that the headquarters of Dove Soap is located in the Eastern Time zone.\n\nPassage 2 provides the same phone number as Passage 1 for contacting a live representative, but also notes that this number is available 24 hours a day / 7 days a week for medical or product safety emergencies. This indicates that the headquarters of Dove Soap is open for business operations 24/7.\n\nPassage 3 does not provide any information about the location of Dove Soap's headquarters.\n\nTherefore, based on the given passages, the headquarters of Dove Soap can be located in the Eastern Time zone and is open for business operations 24/7.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 11.522, "generation_time_seconds": 11.4904, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0271, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 785, 32711, 7354, 525, 24391, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 1