{"id": "107", "question": "what is the difference between the leeward and windward islands?", "gt": "The Windward and Leeward Islands are part of the Lesser Antilles of the Caribbean Sea. The Windward Islands are in the southeast and are exposed to the northeast trade winds, hence they receive more rain and are wetter. On the other hand, the Leeward Islands are located in the northwest and are away from the wind, making them drier.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Identify the location and characteristics of the leeward and windward islands.\n2. Compare the climate, weather patterns, and vegetation of the leeward and windward islands.\n3. Analyze the differences in the marine life and fishing resources available in the leeward and windward islands.\n4. Consider the impact of these differences on the local economies and cultures of the islands.\n5. Summarize the key differences between the leeward and windward islands based on the information provided in the passages.\nThe reasoning steps are:\n3. Analyze the differences in the marine life and fishing resources available in the leeward and windward islands.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 24.108, "generation_time_seconds": 24.0555, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0415, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 64547, 279, 3728, 323, 17452, 315, 279, 512, 24035, 323, 9956, 1606, 29000, 624, 17, 13, 23768, 279, 9977, 11, 9104, 12624, 11, 323, 53732, 315, 279, 512, 24035, 323, 9956, 1606, 29000, 624, 18, 13, 37427, 2986, 279, 11799, 304, 279, 28591, 2272, 323, 19948, 4963, 2500, 304, 279, 512, 24035, 323, 9956, 1606, 29000, 624, 19, 13, 21144, 279, 5421, 315, 1493, 11799, 389, 279, 2205, 36571, 