{"id": "705", "question": "what do children learn with water play", "gt": "Based on the given passages, children learn the following through water play:\n\n1. Gross motor skills: Running, pouring, and manipulating water helps develop fine and gross motor skills. (Passage 1)\n2. Science concepts: Floating and sinking, measurement, and experimentation with different objects in water. (Passage 1)\n3. Creativity and imagination: Water play encourages children to use their imagination and engage in pretend play. (Passage 1)\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages. The passages do not mention any other specific academic learning outcomes beyond gross motor skills, science concepts, and creativity.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nBased on the given passage, it does not provide specific details about what children learn with water play. Therefore, we cannot extract information to answer the question.\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.\nThe reasoning steps are:\nThe reasoning steps are:\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 15.645, "generation_time_seconds": 15.5942, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0425, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 64547, 279, 1376, 6813, 315, 3015, 1486, 624, 17, 13, 37427, 2986, 279, 16229, 7567, 429, 2841, 646, 42430, 504, 3015, 1486, 624, 18, 13, 39565, 3151, 10295, 476, 3565, 429, 1824, 279, 16229, 13566, 315, 3015, 1486, 624, 19, 13, 1200, 857, 448, 264, 15817, 4226, 3118, 389, 279, 6358, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 15164