{"id": "719", "question": "how to poach an egg using a poachpod", "gt": "To poach an egg using a PoachPod, follow these steps:\n\n1. Begin by bringing a large pot of water to a boil.\n2. Gently slide an egg into your silicone poaching pod, taking care not to break the egg's yolk.\n3. Float the poaching pod in the boiling water, ensuring that the pod stays upright and no water gets inside.\n4. Cover the pot with a tight-fitting lid and allow the egg to cook for 6 minutes.\n5. After 6 minutes, remove the lid from the pot and use a large slotted spoon or tongs to carefully lift the poaching pod out of the hot water.\n6. Flip the poaching pod upside down over a plate and gently press on the bottom to release the poached egg onto the plate.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Identify the steps to poach an egg using a poachpod.\n2. Explain how to prepare the poachpod.\n3. Describe the process of adding the egg to the poachpod.\n4. Discuss any additional steps or tips for successful poaching.\nAnswer: Identify the steps to poach an egg using a poachpod.\nThe reasoning steps are:\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 15.309, "generation_time_seconds": 15.2559, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0461, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 64547, 279, 7354, 311, 3193, 610, 458, 18636, 1667, 264, 3193, 610, 39073, 624, 17, 13, 81917, 1246, 311, 10549, 279, 3193, 610, 39073, 624, 18, 13, 60785, 279, 1882, 315, 7842, 279, 18636, 311, 279, 3193, 610, 39073, 624, 19, 13, 65279, 894, 5107, 7354, 476, 10414, 369, 6849, 3193, 11829, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0, -1.0062, -0.0002, -0.2735, -0.0019, -4.8781, -2.253, -0.0659, -0.0003, -0.0017, 0.0, -0.0105, -0.0024,