{"id": "54", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n\n* Helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by eliminating pesky germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush.\n* Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n* Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food particles from areas that brushing cannot access.\n\nTherefore, using a water pick can be an effective addition to your oral hygiene routine, complementing traditional brushing and flossing methods.", "pred": "Benefits of a water pick include proper oral hygiene, which can help prevent cavities and gum disease.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Answer: Benefits of a water pick include proper oral hygiene, which can help prevent cavities and gum disease.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the specific benefits of a water pick as mentioned in the passage.\nIdentify the specific benefits of a water pick as mentioned in the passage.\nAnswer: Benefits of a water pick include proper oral hygiene, which can help prevent cavities and gum disease.\nIdentify the specific benefits of a water pick as mentioned in the passage.\nAnswer: Benefits of a water pick include proper oral hygiene, which can help prevent cavities and gum disease.\n\nAnswer: Benefits of a water pick include proper oral hygiene, which can help prevent cavities and gum disease.", "time_sec": 17.572, "generation_time_seconds": 17.5344, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0316, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 64547, 279, 1376, 13566, 315, 279, 3405, 25, 576, 3405, 17064, 911, 279, 330, 67144, 1199, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 1189, 1096, 23945, 582, 1184, 311, 23643, 279, 6785, 13566, 476, 22146, 315, 1667, 264, 3