{"id": "108", "question": "what is the difference between the leeward and windward islands?", "gt": "The Windward Islands are exposed to the wind of the northeast trade winds and are located on the southeastern side of the Caribbean Sea. The Leeward Islands, on the other hand, are located on the northwestern side of the Lesser Antilles and are away from the wind. The windward side receives more rain and is wetter, while the leeward side is drier but still receives some rain.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Identify the locations of the Leeward and Windward islands.\n2. Compare the environmental influences on each set of islands.\n3. Analyze the effects of these influences on vegetation, climate, and wildlife.\n4. Summarize the differences in characteristics between the two types of islands. Answer: Unable to answer based on given passages.\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.\nThe reasoning steps are:\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 25.009, "generation_time_seconds": 24.9732, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0305, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 64547, 279, 10468, 315, 279, 1967, 24035, 323, 22087, 1606, 29000, 624, 17, 13, 23768, 279, 12158, 33353, 389, 1817, 738, 315, 29000, 624, 18, 13, 37427, 2986, 279, 6239, 315, 1493, 33353, 389, 53732, 11, 9977, 11, 323, 29305, 624, 19, 13, 8116, 5612, 551, 279, 11799, 304, 17452, 1948, 279, 1378, 4494, 315, 29000, 13, 21806, 25, 41444, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0, -1.2131, -0.0002, -0.1776, -0.0131, -3.2252, -0.0453, -0.0015, -1.369, -0.0, -0.043, -0.0001, 0.0, -0.2092, -0.0735, -0.0167, 0.0