{"id": "226", "question": "how to fix lift valve in toilet", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to fix a lift valve in a toilet:\n\n1. Shut off the water supply valve to the toilet.\n2. Remove the old flapper valve and any remaining pieces of the broken lift chain from the lift arm.\n3. Install the new flapper valve and connect the chain to the third hole on the lift arm, making sure it is securely fastened.\n4. Open the water valve to fill the tank and flush the toilet to test for correct operation.\n5. Adjust the chain as needed to ensure a proper flush. Cut off any excess chain to prevent tangling.\n\nNote: If the toilet flushes slowly, adjust the chain to make it a little tighter on the lift arm.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\nThe reasoning steps are:\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 11.387, "generation_time_seconds": 11.3443, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0363, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 1516