{"id": "656", "question": "how to properly clean your hair", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to properly clean your hair:\n\n1. Rinse your hair completely with water.\n2. Use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair.\n3. Apply a conditioner and allow it to remain on for a few minutes.\n4. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\n5. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing the hair back and forth or in circles.\n\nAdditionally, it is recommended to use a hair dryer to completely dry your hair after washing, and to be gentle when handling wet hair to prevent damage.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\nThe reasoning steps are:\nThe reasoning steps are:\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 7.213, "generation_time_seconds": 7.1759, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0321, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 19432, 287, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 582, 653, 537, 614, 894, 1995, 8826, 279, 6169, 15826, 5413, 369, 6869, 13, 15277, 11, 582, 4157, 3410, 264, 3151, 4226, 3118, 389, 279, 1995, 3897, 382], "logp_list": [-0.0, -5.454, -5.0146, -0.006, -0.3623, -3.5788, -0.3541, -2.3261, -3.1092, -0.0, -0.1025, -0.7992, -1.7161, -3.0344, -0.5844, -0.119, -1.9189, -0.8148, -0.0023, -0.0022, -0.0072, -0.8292, -0.0032, -0.2569, -0.079, -0.2256, -0.2037, -0.697, -0.0047, -0.3698, -0.0068, -0.0049, -0.9727, -0.3236, -0.9922], "cumulative_logprob": -34.2754, "norm_logp": -0.9793, "input_len": 142, "output_tokens": 35}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 1, "token_ids": [198, 17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 1